  "strengths": [
    "Adds long retention to Prometheus without changing how scraping works",
    "Global PromQL view across clusters with HA-pair deduplication",
    "Object storage makes multi-year retention inexpensive",
    "Downsampling speeds up long-range queries",
    "Apache-2.0 and vendor-neutral under the CNCF"
  ],
  "weaknesses": [
    "Many components (sidecar, store, querier, compactor, ruler, receive) to operate",
    "Recent data depends on reaching every sidecar, so a slow cluster slows global queries",
    "Compactor must run as a singleton per bucket and can fall behind",
    "Still pre-1.0 versioning after years of production use"
  ],
